{"id":"n15168-1-7","stage":2,"title":"여가 · 空闲","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15168-1-7-1","ko":"뭔가 신선한 여가 활동이 없을까?","zh":"有没有什么新鲜有趣的休闲活动呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭔가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭔가","audio":"/audio/7f3853a0ea8084aa255c.mp3"}},{"text":"신선한","meaning":"新颖，清新","explanation":"신선하다：新颖，清新；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"신선하다","audio":"/audio/c045ea8767dad6e8f0a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65343","senseId":"1","lemma":"신선하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신선한","audio":"/audio/a1ca0f4eca6c6959ce70.mp3"}},{"text":"여가","meaning":"空闲，余暇","explanation":"여가：空闲，余暇","readings":[{"term":"여가","audio":"/audio/3dc88a68357f52cbf97f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15168","senseId":"1","lemma":"여가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여가","audio":"/audio/3dc88a68357f52cbf97f.mp3"}},{"text":"활동이","meaning":"活动","explanation":"활동：活动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"활동","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74135","senseId":"2","lemma":"활동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"활동이","audio":"/audio/2fb230f28d528c1ac9af.mp3"}},{"text":"없을까?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없을까","audio":"/audio/41b085a28423a60bd513.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"c045ea8767dad6e8","term":"신선하다","zh":"新颖，清新","audio":"/audio/c045ea8767dad6e8f0a5.mp3","entryId":"65343","definition":"新鲜清爽。","pronunciation":["신선하다"]},{"id":"3dc88a68357f52cb","term":"여가","zh":"空闲，余暇","audio":"/audio/3dc88a68357f52cbf97f.mp3","entryId":"15168","definition":"不工作的时间；或指工作时的闲暇时间。","pronunciation":["여가"]},{"id":"d4b47a5cf76094e9","term":"활동","zh":"活动","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3","entryId":"74135","definition":"为在某事中取得好结果而努力。","pronunciation":["활똥"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某个事实或现象在现实里不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/342a4be3bf8046f690c3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15168-1-7-2","ko":"운동을 해 보는 건 어때?","zh":"试试做运动怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做、进行（运动）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（运动）；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"보는","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보는","audio":"/audio/8103e7fed907b17e57e3.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行（运动）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行（运动）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/81c1c07add86ab3eb605.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.62,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15168","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":84,"sequenceScore":2.3453,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["试试做运动怎么样？","冰箱里一点食物都没有啊？","有没有什么新鲜有趣的休闲活动呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["试试做运动怎么样？","有没有什么新鲜有趣的休闲活动呢？","冰箱里一点食物都没有啊？"],"answer":0}]}
